  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infrastructure Transport Program (PIT)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Infraestructura de Transporte (PIT)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Contribuir al desarrollo del sector transporte a travs de la mejora de la infraestructura vial y portuaria, lo que beneficiar las condiciones de movilidad de las personas y los bienes, facilitando el flujo de comercio y la integracin econmica regional de Costa Rica.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribute to the development of the transport sector through the improvment of road and port infrastructure, which will benefit the conditions of mobility of people and goods, facilitating the flow of trade and regional economic integration of Costa Rica.</narrative>
  </description>
